Task: You will be provided with a list of leaf links coming from an URDF model. Identify all URDF leaf links that represent or belong to a end_effector instance, as functional origins, internal assemblies or interaction frames. 

Input Format: 
List of URDF leaf links: ["leaf_1", "leaf_2", ...]

Output Format:
Respond strictly in JSON following this structure: 
{
    "identifications":
    {
        "end_effector_0": {"link_name": "string", "justification": "string"}
    }
}

For each justification attribute, provide a single, self-sufficient, clear sentence explaining the reason for your choice.
Do not include any extra text or markdown formatting.

generation:
